          "docs": "Standard ArcGIS REST query against layer 0. Supports SQL `where` clauses, attribute selection, spatial filters, ordering, statistics and pagination (`resultOffset` + `resultRecordCount`, `advancedQueryCapabilities.supportsPagination` is true). Page size is capped at 2000 features (32000 with `returnGeometry=false`). Output formats are JSON, geoJSON and PBF."
